     A**********************************************************************
     A* STACTPNL - Shared Action Panel display file (REVERSE-ENGINEERED).
     A* - RCDSYSTBL: q1user/q1pgm/q1prms job context + sccompname.
     A* - RCDACTPL : panel-height fields (APnlHeight/AMenHeight/APFootHght).
     A*   Renamed from RCDPANEL to avoid colliding with WTAGTCFG.dspf's
     A*   own RCDPANEL format.
     A* HTML('QPUIREC...') keywords flag this as a Profound UI rich
     A* display file so the PROFOUNDUI(HANDLER) accepts the OPEN.
     A* CSS layout fixes are loaded site-wide via a <link> tag in
     A* /www/profoundui/htdocs/profoundui/userdata/html/start.html
     A* that pulls in /profoundui/userdata/css/wtagtcfg-fix.css
     A* (source-of-truth at src/Sapiens/wtagtcfg-fix.css).
     A* REPLACE WITH SAPIENS-SUPPLIED DDS BEFORE PRODUCTION.
     A**********************************************************************
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      INDARA
     A          R RCDSYSTBL
     A                                  1  2HTML('QPUIREC1    ROVERLAY   0     -
     A                                      RASSUME    0     ')
     A                                  1  2HTML('{"screen":{"record format nam-
     A                                      e":"rcdSysTbl","overlay":"true","ass-
     A                                      ume":"true"},"items":[]}')
     A            Q1USER        10A  H      TEXT('Active user')
     A            Q1PGM         10A  H      TEXT('Calling program')
     A            Q1PRMS         3S 0H      TEXT('Parameter count')
     A            Q1JOB         10A  H      TEXT('Job name')
     A            Q1JOBNBR       6S 0H      TEXT('Job number')
     A            SCCOMPNAME    40A  H      TEXT('Company name display')
     A          R RCDACTPL
     A                                  1  2HTML('QPUIREC2    ROVERLAY   0     -
     A                                      RASSUME    0     ')
     A                                  1  2HTML('{"screen":{"record format nam-
     A                                      e":"rcdActPl","overlay":"true","ass-
     A                                      ume":"true"},"items":[]}')
     A            APNLHEIGHT     5S 0H      TEXT('Action panel height')
     A            APFOOTHGHT     5S 0H      TEXT('Action panel footer height')
     A            AMENHEIGHT     5S 0H      TEXT('Action menu height')
     A            PNLWIDTH       5S 0H      TEXT('Panel width')
     A            PNLTITLE      80A  H      TEXT('Panel title')
